Package: DRUID
Title: Drug Indication Discoverer
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Diogo", "Camacho", email = "diogo.camacho@wyss.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Rank compounds whose transcriptional signatures mimic or revert a
    query gene expression profile. Uses dual TF-IDF corpus weighting (default
    geometric mean), cosine similarity, and an empirical null model.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/diogocamacho/druid
BugReports: https://github.com/diogocamacho/druid/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
